Subject: [PATCH] ag-datovka-compat: load a named endpoint profile

This patch is intentionally kept as a reviewable patch artifact rather than
silently modifying a vendored desktop tree. Apply it only to the pinned
upstream checkout identified in UPSTREAM.md.

Local behavior:

* require an explicit profile name at launch;
* load endpoint, trust-store, and credential-reference fields from that
  profile;
* reject production hostnames and inline secret material before networking;
* keep the offline-fixture profile network-free.

The patch does not add server code, former AGDatovka code/data, credentials,
private keys, or a production endpoint.
